 "description": "{\"ops\":[{\"insert\":\"Goblin tokens with \"},{\"insert\":{\"card-link\":\"Krenko, Mob Boss\"}},{\"insert\":\". Pretty self explanatory. Get a bunch of guys and sac them to \"},{\"insert\":{\"card-link\":\"Goblin Bombardment\"}},{\"insert\":\" or have \"},{\"insert\":{\"card-link\":\"Impact Tremors\"}},{\"insert\":\" or \"},{\"insert\":{\"card-link\":\"Purphoros, God of the Forge\"}},{\"insert\":\"  deal damage when they come in. \"},{\"insert\":{\"card-link\":\"Boggart Shenanigans\"}},{\"insert\":\" and \"},{\"insert\":{\"card-link\":\"Outpost Siege\"}},{\"insert\":\" hit them as the gobs of goblins die.\u00a0 There are lots of ways to give haste and untap the Mob Boss.\\n\\nThe cards in the sideboard are there to switch the Krenko list to a Muxus list. \\n\\nUmbral Mantle > Muxus\\nThornbite Staff > Grenzo\\nMassive Raid > Bloodmark Mentor\\nMana Echoes > Goblin King\\nThousand Year Elixir > Abrade\\nLightning Greaves > Conjurer's Closet\\nPurphoros > Panharmonicon\\nMountain > Kazuul's Fury\\n\\n\\n\\n\"}]}",
